//@version=6
// GoldGuard v2.0.0 Stable Reload. Causal Intrabar/Closed-Bar Exit Sync + Regime-Segmented 3-Core Methods + Permanent Telemetry.
// Honest OHLC/Intrabar execution model: entries & stop moves on confirmed bars; TP/SL monitored intrabar & cross-TF without future leak.
